WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Map. Inspect 250 historical locations before fitting any model.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Group. Find location groups using a geographic distance and a chosen neighborhood size.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Reveal. Add pumps as context after fitting; they were not model inputs.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Question. Change the distance and ask what additional evidence an investigation needs.
